ok satellite.include(satellite) makes this file a program
ok capsule with no parameters
ok capsule with one parameter
ok capsule with three parameters of three types
ok capsule arguments worked out where the call is
ok capsule call inside a call
ok capsule answers inside a line
ok capsule declared after main is called from it
ok capsule in a satellite.namespace, called by its space
ok a bare name in a space is found in its space, then in the file around it
ok one name in the file and in a space: each space's bare name finds its own
ok capsule answers a list
ok capsule's list answer kept in a variable
ok comment between a capsule's ) and {
ok several returns in one capsule: the first one reached ends it
ok satellite.return inside an if inside a while ends the capsule
ok satellite.return inside an if inside a for ends the capsule, or the one after the loop
ok satellite.return() hands back nothing and ends the capsule
ok a capsule with no satellite.return ends at its }
ok recursion: factorial(25), exact
ok recursion with work after the call, 10,000 deep
ok recursion as the last act, 100,000 deep
ok two capsules calling each other, 1,001 deep
ok satellite.statement.if, .else and else-if take the right branch
ok satellite.statement.if (!(...)) -- not
ok satellite.statement.while runs until its condition is false, and not at all when it starts false
ok satellite.statement.for with + 1, and a body that changes the capsule's name
ok satellite.statement.for with ++ and --
ok satellite.statement.for with * 2
ok satellite.statement.for with no step, the body moving the number
ok satellite.statement.for with / 2, - 3 and + 4, and one whose condition starts false
ok satellite.statement.for inside a for
ok satellite.statement.for whose condition calls a method each pass
ok a for's own number is a free name after its loop
ok satellite.statement.break leaves a while
ok satellite.statement.break() leaves only the nearest loop
ok satellite.statement.continue starts a for's next pass
ok satellite.statement.continue() starts a while's next pass
ok a break inside an else, and a continue inside an else-if
ok an if inside a while, and a while inside an if
ok a name declared in a loop's body is made again every pass
ok a trailing comment ends the line it follows
ok // inside quotes is text, not a comment
ok a line written after // never runs
ok comments after a while, its braces and its lines
ok a comment holding braces, quotes and code changes nothing
ok every pass answered alike
ok satellite.return(satellite) ends the whole program from a capsule 50 deep, exit 0
